# Serie D (EN): il Sole nei 12 segni, un discorso unico per segno che cita le tradizioni.
PLANET='Sun'
COVER_SUB='What your Sun really feels like, sign by sign.'
S=[
('Aries','Fire · cardinal','Exalted','The Sun is at its brightest here, and you feel it. You are direct, restless and happiest when you are the one who starts things. Courage comes before calculation, and you would rather try and fail than wait and wonder. Anger flares fast and fades faster. The lesson is patience: not every fight is yours to win today.'),
('Taurus','Earth · fixed','Calm and steady','The Sun slows down in Taurus. You build things that last, you trust what you can touch, and you do not change your mind easily. Comfort, good food and loyalty matter to you. People find you reliable, sometimes stubborn. The old astrologers saw a quiet strength here, the kind that waits until the harvest is ready.'),
('Gemini','Air · mutable','Curious and quick','Here the Sun becomes a messenger. You think fast, talk easily and get bored just as easily. Your mind jumps between ideas, people and projects, and you learn best by asking questions. You can charm almost anyone, but your real challenge is staying with one thing long enough to go deep.'),
('Cancer','Water · cardinal','Guest in the Moon’s house','The Sun is a guest in the Moon’s own home, so your identity is shaped by feeling and memory. You protect the people you love fiercely and you remember everything. Moods rise and fall like tides. Behind the shell there is great tenderness, and the work is learning to care without holding on too tight.'),
('Leo','Fire · fixed','At home','The Sun is at home in Leo, and it shows. You are warm, generous and made to be seen. You lead naturally, love to create and give your heart completely. Pride is the weak spot: you can be hurt by being ignored. At its best this is a king who lifts everyone around him, not one who needs the crown.'),
('Virgo','Earth · mutable','Careful and useful','The Sun looks at the details in Virgo. You notice what others miss, you want things done properly and you show love by being useful. You are modest, analytical and often harder on yourself than on anyone else. The gift is craft and care; the lesson is that good enough is sometimes truly enough.'),
('Libra','Air · cardinal','Weakened','The Sun sits uneasily in Libra, because Libra defines itself through other people. You are gracious, fair and a natural peacemaker, but you can lose yourself in what others expect. Choosing is hard when you see every side. Growth comes when you learn to say what you want, even if it disturbs the harmony.'),
('Scorpio','Water · fixed','Deep and intense','The Sun goes below the surface in Scorpio. You feel everything strongly and show only part of it. You are loyal, perceptive and drawn to what is hidden, from secrets to the psychology of crisis. You do not do things halfway. The challenge is trust: letting go of control, and learning that rebirth follows every ending.'),
('Sagittarius','Fire · mutable','Open and searching','The Sun heads for the horizon in Sagittarius. You are optimistic, frank and hungry for freedom, travel and meaning. You learn by exploring, and you can inspire people with sheer enthusiasm. The risk is promising more than you deliver, or preaching what you only just discovered. Truth matters most to you.'),
('Capricorn','Earth · cardinal','Disciplined','The Sun is born again in Capricorn, at the winter solstice, when the light slowly returns. You are patient, responsible and willing to work for years toward a goal. You seem serious young and lighter with age. Success comes through structure. The lesson is warmth: authority is stronger when it is human.'),
('Aquarius','Air · fixed','Detached and original','The Sun feels a little out of place in Aquarius, and that is exactly the point. You are independent, inventive and committed to ideas bigger than yourself. You value friends and causes, and you can seem distant when your feelings run deep. You are here to be different and to make the group better for it.'),
('Pisces','Water · mutable','Sensitive and dreamy','The Sun dissolves into the sea in Pisces. You are intuitive, compassionate and moved by music, art and other people’s pain. Boundaries are thin, so you absorb the moods around you. Imagination is your greatest gift. The challenge is staying grounded, so that your kindness does not become a way to disappear.'),
]
